			"text": "| Property    | Meaning                      |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Atomicity   | All or nothing               |\n| Consistency | Database rules remain valid  |\n| Isolation   | Transactions don't interfere |\n| Durability  | Committed data is permanent  |",
			"rawText": "| Property    | Meaning                      |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Atomicity   | All or nothing               |\n| Consistency | Database rules remain valid  |\n| Isolation   | Transactions don't interfere |\n| Durability  | Committed data is permanent  |",
